      ],
      "facts": {
        "question": "Does an undeployed Peripheral (Ancillary) count as Killed for scenario objectives?",
        "answer": "No. An Ancillary only counts as Killed if it was deployed during the game and either entered Dead State or remains in a Null State at the end of the game. This is a specific exception when counting Killed units in scenario objectives.",
